			String _text = "a primitive 3x3 Bloomery Smelter to process 21 Copper Ore, 3 Tin Ore, 6 Charcoal & 13 Clay into approx. 9 Bronze. Due to the intense heat and the only way to extract the Bronze from the smelter, when finished it will be destroyed and removed. A new smelter will need to be made for further production.";
